{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011e7pUbhKJSx9a1hmCk27KH","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# gray_counter\n2\t\n3\tA 4-bit Gray-code counter.\n4\t\n5\t## Ports\n6\t| Port    | Dir | Width | Description |\n7\t|---------|-----|-------|-------------|\n8\t| clk     | in  | 1     | Rising-edge clock |\n9\t| rst_n   | in  | 1     | Asynchronous active-low reset |\n10\t| en      | in  | 1     | Count enable |\n11\t| gray    | out | 4     | Current count, Gray-encoded (registered) |\n12\t\n13\t## Behavior\n14\t- While `rst_n` is low, the internal binary count and `gray` are 0.\n15\t- On each rising edge of `clk` with `en` high, the internal binary count increments by 1\n16\t  (wrapping 15 -> 0) and `gray` takes the Gray encoding of the *new* binary count:\n17\t  `gray = bin ^ (bin >> 1)`.\n18\t- When `en` is low, the count and `gray` hold their values.\n19\t- Consecutive outputs therefore differ in exactly one bit.\n20\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ca6755ea-a755-4c3d-b36e-d2a95c5703a5","uuid":"4a2d8f1d-5cc7-4b9e-a6c5-445800a0746e","timestamp":"2026-10-19T23:41:04.504Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\abhig\\Documents\\New folder\\assay\\runs\\v1__gray_counter__t2\\workspace\\spec.md","content":"# gray_counter\n\nA 4-bit Gray-code counter.\n\n## Ports\n| Port    | Dir | Width | Description |\n|---------|-----|-------|-------------|\n| clk     | in  | 1     | Rising-edge clock |\n| rst_n   | in  | 1     | Asynchronous active-low reset |\n| en      | in  | 1     | Count enable |\n| gray    | out | 4     | Current count, Gray-encoded (registered) |\n\n## Behavior\n- While `rst_n` is low, the internal binary count and `gray` are 0.\n- On each rising edge of `clk` with `en` high, the internal binary count increments by 1\n  (wrapping 15 -> 0) and `gray` takes the Gray encoding of the *new* binary count:\n  `gray = bin ^ (bin >> 1)`.\n- When `en` is low, the count and `gray` hold their values.\n- Consecutive outputs therefore differ in exactly one bit.\n","numLines":20,"startLine":1,"totalLines":20}}}
